section "tome-cults/data/birth/demented.lua"

t("Demented", "瘋狂系", "birth descriptor name")
t("The thirst for knowledge is seen by most arcane users as as good thing.", "對知識的渴望是大部分奧術使用者的共同特點。", "_t")
t("But some take it too far, some delve into lost knowledge. They may gain huge power from it, but at what cost?", "但某些人走得太遠，某些人陷入失落的知識中。他們或許得到了巨大的力量，但代價是什麼呢？", "_t")
t("Writhing One", "苦痛者", "birth descriptor name")
t("Writhing Ones know that what we call #{italic}#horrors#{normal}# hold the key to some ancient knowledge and power from the Age of Haze and they are ready to do anything to access it.", "苦痛者瞭解我們所謂的 #{italic}#恐魔#{normal}# 是通往遠古知識和混沌紀力量的鑰匙。他們願意付出一切代價來獲取。", "_t")
t("In their lust for power they somehow lost a part of themselves, turning more and more into the horrors they study.", "在極度渴求力量的同時，他們似乎失去了部分自我，和他們所研究的恐魔越來越相似。", "_t")
t("Most of them forgo an entire arm to turn it into a deadly tentacle.", "他們中大部分人選擇將一整隻手臂化作致命觸手。", "_t")
t("Some are even known to never leave their sanctuary without their own worm that walks friend.", "某些人甚至拒絕在沒有蠕蟲合體的陪同下離開避難所。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Magic", "他們最重要的屬性是：力量和魔法。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD# 屬性修正：", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +3 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 力量, +0 敏捷, +3 體質", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Magic, +0 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 魔法, +0 意志, +0 靈巧", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +3", "#GOLD# 每等級生命加值： #LIGHT_BLUE# +3", "_t")
t("Cultist of Entropy", "熵教徒", "birth descriptor name")
t("Everything ends eventually. Harness this inevitability.", "萬物終將消亡。這一點可以被利用。", "_t")
t("Cultists of Entropy are doomed beings which have unlocked the secrets of using entropy as a weapon. Their spells cause their bodies to wither away from entropic backlash, but they have learned how to resist this backlash and even pass it onto their foes.", "熵教徒是被詛咒的存在，他們能使用熵作爲武器。他們的法術產生熵能反衝傷害自身，但他們學會如何抵抗反衝甚至將其轉移至敵人身上。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic and Cunning", "他們最重要的屬性是：魔法和靈巧。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 力量 , +0 敏捷 , +0 體質", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +6 Magic, +0 Willpower, +3 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +6 魔法 , +0 意志 , +3 靈巧", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# -4", "#GOLD# 每等級生命加值： #LIGHT_BLUE# -4", "_t")

