section "tome-cults/data/chats/fanged-collar.lua"

t("#{italic}##GREY#You feel the creeping blackness of oblivion overtaking you. Somehow, the darkness does not completely enclose around you. Something else is here with you. You feel as though it wishes to help you. Wordlessly, it reassures you that everything will be fine and that it can help you escape your fate. You only have to say yes.#{normal}#", "#{italic}##GREY#你感受到湮滅的黑暗淹沒了你。不知爲何，黑暗並沒有完全包圍你。有什麼東西似乎正在陪伴着你，你覺得它似乎想要幫助你。它無言地的向你承諾，一切都會好起來的，他可以幫你脫離死亡的命運。你只要說“是”就行了。#{normal}#", "_t")
t("Silently you agree. You want to live!", "你默默的同意了，你想活下去！", "_t")
t("Silently you refuse, the presence creeps you out too much.", "你默默地拒絕了，這個存在太可怕了。", "_t")
t("#{italic}##GREY#The presence shirks back sadly, but you feel like it has respected your decision. It allows you to find the peace that only death can give.#{normal}#", "#{italic}##GREY#那個存在傷心地離開了，但是你覺得它尊重了你的選擇。它讓你尋找到了只有死亡才能給你的平和安寧。#{normal}#", "_t")
t("[die]", "[你死了]", "_t")
t("#{italic}##GREY#You do not want to die. Without a second thought, you accept its offer. Happily, the presence begins to do... something. You start to wake up and you feel life returning to your limbs. However, you have a splitting headache and your neck won't stop hurting. Just what did the presence do to bring you back from the brink?#{normal}#", "#{italic}##GREY#你可不想死。不需要多少思考，你同意了這個請求。那個東西高興地開始做了…某件事。你醒了過來，感受到生命重新充滿了你的四肢。然而，你仍然感覺頭痛欲裂，你的脖子也很痛。到底是什麼把你從死亡的邊緣帶了回來？#{normal}#", "_t")
t("...", "……", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#Strange... You're pretty sure you died, but you're still here. It does feel like something important is missing, however. Your neck also feels incredibly sore and you have a splitting headache. Somehow, you get the subtle impression that you shouldn't look in a mirror anytime soon.", "#CRIMSON#好奇怪…你很確定你已經死了，但你還活着。然而，你還是覺得你少了什麼重要的東西。你的脖子很痛，你還是覺得很頭疼。不知爲何，你隱約感覺你不應該照鏡子。", "log")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/data/chats/godfeaster-malyu-escaped.lua"

t([[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#Fresh air!#{normal}##LAST#
Nice job! You handled yourself a lot better than I thought you would. Now, usually I get a reward... What? Why are you looking at me like that? I'm obviously the one who saved you here. It's customary for adventurers to get rewarded when they do a good deed.]], [[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#新鮮的空氣！#{normal}##LAST#
幹得好！你做的比我想象中的好多了。現在，一般我會得到一個獎勵…唔？你爲什麼這麼看着我？很顯然，我救了你。冒險者做好事的時候通常會得到獎勵。]], "_t")
t("[Offer to teach her '%s'.]", "[同意教她 '%s'。]", "tformat")
t("[Offer her stat increases.]", "[你決定增加她的屬性。]", "_t")
t("[Offer her nothing.]", "[你什麼也不給她。]", "_t")
t("Oh this will sure come in handy! Thanks!", "哦，這個技能很有用！謝謝！", "_t")
t("Take care!", "那就這樣吧，再見！", "_t")
t("I always did want to learn how to do these kind of things!", "太好了！我一直想要學這種東西！", "_t")
t("Oh, I suddenly feel like I have potential to grow.", "哦，我覺得我的潛能增長了！", "_t")
t("...Fine, be that way. Good luck out there, though.", "…好吧，就這樣吧。祝你一路順風！", "_t")
t("You too!", "你也是！", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/data/chats/godfeaster-malyu.lua"

t("#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#As you move you suddenly find yourself entrapped in a hidden digestive sack that seems to void all your abilities!#{normal}##LAST#", "#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#在你向前移動的時候，你突然發現自己掉進了一個隱藏的消化袋裏，它似乎要耗盡你所有的能力！#{normal}##LAST#", "_t")
t("[try to kick your way out]", "[試着拳打腳踢]", "_t")
t("[try to cut your way out]", "[試着拿劍亂砍]", "_t")
t("[try to shout your way out]", "[試着喊救命]", "_t")
t([[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#As were starting to lose hope you hear some kind of cutting.#{normal}##LAST#
There's someone else in here?]], [[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#在你快要放棄希望的時候，你聽到了切開東西的聲音。#{normal}##LAST#
有人在裏面嗎？]], "_t")
t("Who..what.. YES!", "是誰…什麼…對！我在裏面!", "_t")
t([[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#As the sack gets cut and you regain your mobility you see your savior is some kind of adventurer, she was probably eaten by the Godfeaster too.#{normal}##LAST#
This thing ate you too? Hey, at least you've got company. Name's Malyu, I've been stuck in here for a few days now and had to tough it out alone. I was about to go for this thing's brain when you showed up. What say we team up and get out of here together?
]], [[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#當袋子被切破開來，你恢復了你的能力。你看到了救你的人是一個冒險家，她好像也被噬神者吞下了。#{normal}##LAST#
這個東西也吃了你？嘿，至少你有一個伴了。我的名字是Malyu，我在這裏被困了幾天了，不得不獨自面對這一切。我本來準備破壞這個東西的大腦，結果遇到了你。我們一起離開這個地方怎麼樣？
]], "_t")
t("I am glad for the help, you saved me. Let's kill this thing and get out!", "感謝你的幫助，你救了我。我們一起殺了這個怪物，逃出去吧！", "_t")
t("Malyu", "馬呂烏", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/data/chats/space-dwarf-trinket.lua"

t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#Suddenly the strange metallic device emits some beeps and starts to speak. Somehow.#{normal}##LAST#
Uplink established with remote satellite. Activating emergency communication array.
Current user does not match with previous user records. Performing scan.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#突然，奇怪的金屬的機器發出了嗶嗶聲，然後，開始說話了#{normal}##LAST#
與衛星建立上行鏈接。啓動緊急通信陣列。
當前用戶和之前的用戶記錄不匹配。正在掃描。]], "_t")
t("..what?", "..啥啥啥？", "_t")
t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The device beeps again and speaks.#{normal}##LAST#
User's biological signature matches expected species, but does not match any identity records in database. Sending information for further analysis.

User added to database. I am now your personal assistant and will help you survive until further assistance can arrive. Enabling protective electromagnetic barrier and real time health monitoring.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#這個機器嗶嗶了幾下，又說了起來。#{normal}##LAST#
用戶的生理學特徵符合目標物種，但是在數據庫裏並沒有記錄。正在發送信息以供進一步分析。

用戶已添加到數據庫。我現在是你的私人助理，直到進一步的救援前來之前，我會持續照料你。已啓動保護性電磁屏障和實時健康監測程序。]], "_t")
t("Expected species?", "目標物種？", "_t")
t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The device beeps again and speaks.#{normal}##LAST#
User's biological signature indicates dangerous degeneration of genome due to unknown factors. Sending information for further analysis.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#這個機器嗶嗶了幾下，又說了起來。#{normal}##LAST#
由於不明原因，用戶的生理特徵表現出危險的基因劣化。正在發送信息以供進一步分析。]], "_t")
t("Genome?", "基因？", "_t")
t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The device beeps again and speaks.#{normal}##LAST#
No signs of life detected. User appears to be still moving despite absence of living tissue. Sending information for further analysis.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#這個機器嗶嗶了幾下，又說了起來。#{normal}##LAST#
沒有檢測到生命信號。目標看上去在活動，但沒有活着的生物組織。正在發送信息以供進一步分析。]], "_t")
t("Never seen an undead have you?", "看什麼看，沒見過不死生物啊？", "_t")
t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The device beeps again and speaks.#{normal}##LAST#
User's biological signature does not match any currently known species in database. Sending information for further analysis.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#這個機器嗶嗶了幾下，又說了起來。#{normal}##LAST#
用戶的生理學特徵不符合數據庫中的任何已知物種。正在發送信息以供進一步分析。]], "_t")
t("Database?", "數據庫？", "_t")
t("#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The machine beeps twice, then goes completely silent. Any further attempts to get it to speak prove futile.#{normal}##LAST#", "#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#機器發出兩下嗶嗶聲，然後完全安靜了下來。你再也沒法讓它再次說話了。#{normal}##LAST#", "_t")
t("That was weird...", "真奇怪…", "_t")

