section "tome-cults/data/general/events/space-dwarf-ship.lua"

t("floor", "地板", "_t")
t("wall", "牆壁", "_t")
t("strange metallic capsule", "詭異的金屬艙", "_t")
t("Strange metallic capsule", "詭異的金屬艙", "_t")
t("You have already scavenged what you could understand and use.", "你已經找遍了你能理解和使用的東西", "_t")
t([[The thing in front of you appears to be a strange dome made from green glass. Judging by the crater around it, this dome must have crashed into the earth with tremendous force. Stranger still is the figure seated inside it. It appears to be wearing a suit made of an unknown material and a glass dome over its head. Looking inside the dome, you can plainly see that the figure is a dwarf! There is no mistaking that oversized nose. Judging by the smell, he has been dead for quite some time.

You are fairly sure that the dwarves aren't capable of making something like this and they definitely don't dress like that. So, where did this odd dwarf come from? Taking a closer look, you find a strange device attached to the dwarf's arm. You remove it with no small amount of effort. It is completely unlike anything you have seen before and you're not really sure what to make of it. Perhaps if you hold onto it, you might be able to discern its functionality later.]], [[出現在你眼前的是一個被綠色玻璃遮罩的太空艙，根據附近的彈坑判斷，這個太空艙曾以極快的速度撞擊地面，裏面仍坐着一個奇怪的生物，穿着不明材質的衣服，帶着綠色玻璃做成的頭罩。透過綠色的玻璃看去，能看到矮人標誌性的大鼻子，你清楚的發現這是一個矮人！從氣味判斷，他已經死了很久了。

你很肯定矮人不會做出這樣的東西，而且他們絕對不會穿那樣的衣服。那麼，這個奇怪的矮人是從哪裏來的？仔細觀察，你會發現一個奇怪的裝置附在矮人的手臂上。你不費吹灰之力就把它取下來了。這和你以前看到的任何東西都不一樣，你也不知道該怎麼做。如果你堅持住它，也許你可以在以後辨別出它的功能。]], "_t")
t("previous level", "前往上一層", "_t")
t("ladder back to %s", "返回%s的樓梯", "tformat")
t("Eerie Cave", "詭異洞穴", "_t")
t("eerie cave", "詭異的洞穴", "_t")

