t("A reddish attack cell that will crawl to you to distract you while the rest of the organism attacks.", "一團紅色的攻擊細胞，它會爬到你的身邊，在其他器官攻擊你的時候分散你的注意力。", "_t")
t("corrupted protoplasmic controller", "腐化的原生質操控細胞", "entity name")
t("Acid. Fire. Pain.", "酸液。火焰。痛苦。", "_t")
t("corrupted dendritic hemospinner", "腐化的樹突血細胞", "entity name")
t("This strange cell can somehow connect to Eyal itself.", "這個奇怪的細胞似乎可以通過某種方法連接到埃亞爾本身。", "_t")
t("corrupted acidic digestor", "腐化的酸性消化細胞", "entity name")
t("You look like nutriments.", "看來你看起來是某種營養物質。", "_t")
t("corrupted protosentient globula", "腐化的原生球狀細胞", "entity name")
t("A huge globula of protoplasma. You can feel a kind of protosentience emanating from it, and you can tell it is hungry.", "一團球狀的巨大的原生質細胞。從他的身上滲出原生質，你感覺他很飢餓。", "_t")

