section "tome-cults/data/general/npcs/horror.lua"

t("searing horror", "灼熱恐魔", "entity name")
t("And you thought radiant horrors were bad.", "聽說你覺得灼眼恐魔還不夠厲害？", "_t")
t("#GOLD#The Searing Horror adds a reflective shield to its allies!#LAST#", "#GOLD#灼熱恐魔爲它的盟友施加了反射護盾！#LAST#", "say")
t("ravaging entropic rip", "肆虐的熵之裂口", "entity name")
t("A strange crystal/tear in the fabric of reality. You dare not think how it came to be.", "撕裂了現實的一團奇怪的水晶。你不敢想它是從哪裏來的。", "_t")
t("bursting entropic shard", "爆裂的熵之碎片", "entity name")
t("A strange tall crystal pusling with nether energies. It's broken. Tentacles come out of it to get you! #{bold}#RUN!#{normal}#", "一團發射出虛空能量的高大水晶。它的破裂處伸出觸手抓向你。#{bold}#快跑!#{normal}#", "_t")
t("nethergate", "虛空之門", "entity name")
t("A strange portal of nether energies, it somehow feels alive itself.", "散發着虛空能量的奇妙傳送門，好像它本身是活着的。", "_t")
t("It looks inactive and dormant for now. Maybe try to not wake it up.", "它看起來處於不活躍的休眠狀態。最好不要喚醒它。", "_t")
t("It looks active and you can feel dark energies coming out of it.", "它活動了起來，黑暗的能量從中噴涌而出。", "_t")
t("#PURPLE#The nethergate feels a presence nearby and wakes up!", "#PURPLE#虛空之門感受到周圍的存在，甦醒了！", "logSeen")
t("#PURPLE#The nethergate absorbs the attack and stirs, reactivating...", "#PURPLE#虛空之門吸收了攻擊，攪動着重新啓動了……", "logSeen")
t("netherworm mass", "虛空蠕蟲團", "entity name")
t("A disgusting mass of distorted worms, slithering towards you.", "一團令人厭惡的扭曲蠕蟲，正在向你爬行過來。", "_t")
t("%s duplicates the healing forces to %s!", "%s複製治療力量到%s！", "logSeen")
t("giant netherworm", "巨大虛空蠕蟲", "entity name")
t("fearful symmetry", "恐怖的對稱幾何體", "entity name")
t("A strange vortex of malevolent triangles.", "一團三角圖形組成的充滿惡意的漩渦。", "_t")

