section "tome-cults/data/general/objects/special-misc.lua"

t("Robe of the Worm", "蠕蟲長袍", "entity name")
t("worm", "蠕蟲", "entity short_name")
t("Rags of the Sanctuary", "庇護所布衣", "entity name")
t("rags", "布衣", "entity short_name")
t("misc", "雜項", "entity type")
t("tool", "工具", "entity subtype")
t("Bizzare Contraption", "奇怪的設備", "entity name")
t("bizzare contraption", "奇怪的裝置", "_t")
t("This strange device appears to be entirely mechanical in nature, but you cannot understand how any of the components are supposed to work. There does appear to be some sort of metallic grid in its side which sometimes emits strange noises.", "這個奇怪的裝置看上去是完全機械制的，但是你根本不明白這些組件到底是怎麼工作的。在它的側面有着某種金屬的網格，有時會發出奇怪的噪聲。", "_t")
t("10% chance when hit to absorb the whole blow. This effect has a 30 turn cooldown.", "10%機率完全吸收一次攻擊。這一效果具有30回合冷卻時間。", "_t")
t("The Bizzare Contraption fully absorbs the blow (%0.2f damage absorbed).", "奇怪的裝置完全吸收了傷害 (吸收 %0.2f 傷害)。", "logSeen")
t("#{italic}##LIGHT_GREEN#Enabling protective electromagnetic barrier and real time health monitoring.#{normal}#", "#{italic}##LIGHT_GREEN#已開啓保護性電磁屏障和實時健康監測。#{normal}#", "logPlayer")
t("armor", "護甲", "entity type")
t("head", "頭部", "entity subtype")
t("Fanged Collar", "利牙項環", "entity name")
t("It's a head... but is it yours?", "這是一個頭…但是這是你的頭嗎？", "_t")

