section "tome-cults/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua"

t("Spinal Cage", "脊髓籠", "entity name")
t("gross mass of spinal matter", "一團脊髓物質", "_t")
t("A gross mass of spinal matter hastily assembled into armour.", "一團脊髓物質，差不多可以用來當做護甲", "_t")
t("Infused Cerebrum", "被灌注的大腦", "entity name")
t("a disgusting pile of brain-matter", "一團令人厭惡的大腦組織", "_t")
t("This #{italic}#headwear#{normal}# seems made entirely out of half-rotten brain matter. Do you really want to put that over your head?", "這個 #{italic}# “帽子” #{normal}# 似乎是由已經半腐爛的大腦組成的。你真的還想把它呆在自己的頭上嗎？", "_t")
t("assault the mind of a foe to utterly dominate it", "打擊目標的精神，徹底控制它", "_t")
t("%s resists the mental assault!", "%s抵抗了精神攻擊！", "logSeen")
t("Writhing Ring of the Hunter", "獵手的扭曲指環", "entity name")
t("green slimy ring", "綠色粘乎乎的指環", "_t")
t("A writhing mass of tentacles roughtly warped into the form of a ring. A dark malovelant power emanates from it.", "大量扭曲的觸鬚彎曲成了指環的形狀。一團黑暗的惡意力量從裏面散發出來", "_t")
t("When first worn the ring attunes to you, letting you choose a prodigy it will forever grant while worn (can not be changed once chosen, re-wear it to select again if you refused to choose at first).", "當你第一次戴上戒指的時候，選擇一個覺醒技能，你將在戴上這個戒指的時候獲得這個覺醒技能（一旦選擇就不能改變。如果你第一次沒有選擇，可以在重新裝備的時候進行選擇）", "_t")
t("#DARK_SEA_GREEN#While the ring senses battle it grips your finger so hard you can not take it off.", "#DARK_SEA_GREEN#指環感知到了戰鬥，牢牢抓住了你的手指，你無法脫下", "logPlayer")
t("#DARK_SEA_GREEN#As you put the %s on your finger, you feel more attuned to the horror within you.", "#DARK_SEA_GREEN#當你將%s戴在手上，你覺得你和體內的恐魔更加協調了", "logPlayer")
t("Staff of Bones", "白骨法杖", "entity name")
t("bone staff", "骨杖", "_t")
t("A staff made out of the bones of fallen foes. Disgustingly powerful.", "由被擊敗的敵人的白骨製成的法杖。令人厭惡而強大。", "_t")
t("It seems willing and able to talk to you (use Command Staff).", "它似乎願意和你交談（使用法杖掌控）", "_t")
t("Growing more powerful? Still pathetic compared to a True Necromancer!", "變得更強了？你離真正的死靈法師還差得很遠！", "_t")
t("Ahh the rush of power... I love that!", "啊，這股能量……我喜歡這種感覺！", "_t")
t("What feeble power you wield now is nothing!", "你現在掌握的力量多麼微弱啊！", "_t")
t("Yes yes you've leveled up, so what?", "是的，是的，你已經升級了，那又怎樣？", "_t")
t("One more level, that's hardly impressive you know?", "又升了一級，這一點也不意外，你明白嗎？", "_t")
t("If you weren't so useless I'd be nearly impressed by that new level...", "如果不是因爲你這麼沒用，我大概會對這樣新的等級印象深刻…", "_t")
t("KILL! KILL!", "殺！殺！殺！", "_t")
t("We require more souls!", "我們需要更多靈魂！", "_t")
t("Destroy them all! OBEY!", "摧毀他們！服從我！", "_t")
t("FEED ME!", "成爲我的食糧吧！", "_t")
t("I nee ..err.. you need more souls. Yes you...", "我需…啊，不，你需要更多靈魂。是的，你…", "_t")
t("Pain and misery, spread them!", "散播痛苦和不幸吧！", "_t")
t("I love the smell of a fresh corpse.", "我最喜歡新鮮屍體的味道了。", "_t")
t("Splatter me with the blood of our foes!", "把敵人的血濺到我身上！", "_t")
t("That one wasn't such an impressive kill...", "這次殺戮一點都不讓人印象深刻…", "_t")
t("Getting a bit sloppy on the kills no?", "在殺人這件事上是不是有點馬虎了？", "_t")
t("Forbidden Tome: \"Of Knowledge And Horrors\"", "禁忌之書：《知識與恐怖》", "entity name")
t("A gross tome of lost knowledge. Even touching it makes you feel sick.", "一本有關逝去的古老知識的書。光是觸摸它就足以讓你感到不適。", "_t")
t([[The book of horrors,
the book of terrors,
the book of pain,
the book of gain,
the book of insanity,
the book of lunacy.

It which reads the book shall know pain beyond pain.
Read now for a fate worse than death inside awaits.
]], [[恐怖之書，
驚懼之書，
痛苦之書，
收穫之書，
瘋狂之書，
癲狂之書。

讀這本書的人會理解超越痛苦的痛苦。
現在翻開，等待着你的是比死亡更可怕的命運。
]], "_t")
t("Forbidden Tome: \"The Day It Came\"", "禁忌之書：《到來之日》", "entity name")
t("The cover of this tome is old and withered. As you hold it, you get the impression of many things. Despair, misery, desperation and hopelessness all assail you at once. Something about the book also promises great power, but at what cost?", "這本書的封皮老而枯乾。當你拿着它的時候，你感受到絕望、困難，痛苦，無助的感情向你襲來。書中的存在許諾着強大的力量，但是，代價是什麼呢？", "_t")
t("In the Age of Pyre, it seemed that the world was ending to many of Eyal's inhabitants. The destruction caused by the Spellblaze left the land withered and scorched. Food was scarce, paranoia was rampant and everyone was desperate. For a select few, their salvation came from an unlikely visitor. An entity they simply came to knew as The Teacher visited Eyal from somewhere beyond the stars, emerging from an ancient Sher'tul farportal. It discovered a group of survivors in the depths of Eyal which begged it for knowledge, anything they could use as a weapon against the horrors ravaging their world.", "派爾紀對於埃亞爾的許多住民來說如同世界末日一般。魔法大爆炸帶來的毀滅讓大地乾枯焦灼。食物稀缺，偏執和狂熱在人羣中蔓延，人們生活在絕望之中。它們中的少數人從一個不速之客那裏得到了拯救。那位被稱爲“導師”的大師來自遙遠的羣星之間，從一座古老的夏圖爾傳送門中出現。它在埃亞爾召集了一羣渴求知識的倖存者，他們願意使用任何東西作爲武器，對抗這片大地上肆虐的恐怖。", "_t")
t("Hithre died. Somehow this is not what should have happened.", "希瑟爾死了。啊，好像故事本來不應該是這樣的。", "_t")
t("Hithre", "希瑟爾", "_t")
t("Main protagonist", "主角", "_t")
t("The importance of power (+3% spell critical chance)", "力量的重要性(+3% 法術暴擊率)", "_t")
t("The importance of thought (+10 spell save)", "思考的重要性(+10 法術豁免)", "_t")
t("The importance of magic (+5 magic)", "魔法的重要性(+5 魔力)", "_t")
t("The importance of wisdom (+5 willpower)", "智慧的重要性(+5 意志)", "_t")
t("The Day It Came", "到來之日", "_t")
t("This chapter has taught your some important lesson. What did you learn?", "本書教會你許多重要的課程，你學到了什麼嗎？", "_t")
t("Forbidden Tome: \"A View From The Gallery\"", "禁忌之書：《畫廊一瞥》", "entity name")
t("The story of Grung, a halfling separated from his tribe that is just trying to survive while a terrible war, very long ago, rages on.", "這本書講述着格朗格的故事，他是遠古時代的一個半身人，從部落中走散。他只是想生存下去，然而一場毀天滅地的大戰正在他的身邊肆虐。", "_t")
t("It's a cold night and you did not find anything to eat during the day. Your fur pelt doesn't do much to keep the cold out either. You're about to go out to hunt, but everyone else has warned you that you must not do that. The night is dangerous and there appears to be strange lights in the sky. An ill omen, to say the least. Food has been hard to come by lately, so everyone is just as famished as you are.", "今天晚上很冷，白天你沒有找到吃的東西，身上的皮衣此時也起不到什麼禦寒的作用。你正準備出去打獵，但其他人都警告你千萬不要這樣做。夜晚很危險，天空中似乎有奇怪的光線。至少，可以說是一個不好的預兆。但是，最近食物難得，所以大家和你一樣飢腸轆轆。", "_t")
t("Poor Grung. All he wanted was food, but what he found instead was death.", "可憐的格朗格。他只想要得到食物，但是他得到的卻是死亡。", "_t")
t("Grung", "格朗格", "_t")
t("The importance of evading blows (+10 defense)", "閃避攻擊的重要性 (+10 閃避)", "_t")
t("The importance of speed (+10% movement speed)", "速度的重要性 (+10% 移動速度)", "_t")
t("The importance of reflexes (+5 dexterity)", "反應力的重要性 (+5 敏捷)", "_t")
t("The importance of a honed mind (+5 cunning)", "磨礪心智的重要性 (+5 靈巧)", "_t")
t("A View From The Gallery", "畫廊一瞥", "_t")
t("This chapter has taught your some survival tips. What did you learn?", "本書教會教會你一些生存技巧，你學到了什麼嗎？", "_t")
t("Forbidden Tome: \"The Illusory Castle\"", "禁忌之書：《虛幻城堡》", "entity name")
t("The tome in front of you seems to be as much made of dreamstuff as it is from leather and parchment. Crystalline shards dance underneath its surface, giving you an impression of a world altering itself to the tune of some indiscernable logic.", "在你面前的似乎是皮革和羊皮紙製成的夢幻般的東西。水晶般的碎片在它的表面起舞，讓你覺得似乎世界在你的眼前以你無法察覺的邏輯發生着變化的感覺。", "_t")
t([[The world inside the tome depicts a castle. At least, it gives the impression of a castle. It has a dreamlike feeling to it, enough so to make you wonder if you're awake or not. The glass walls shimmer brightly with countless brilliant lights, reflected from some unknown source.

Judging by the way the walls constantly shift and change themselves, you can be certain that this place will be difficult to explore.]], [[書中的世界描繪了一座城堡。至少，它給人的感覺是一座城堡。它有一種如夢似幻的感覺，不禁讓你懷疑自己是否清醒。玻璃牆壁上閃爍着無數絢麗的燈光，不知從哪裏反射過來的。

城堡的牆壁正在不斷移動，變化。你可以確信，這個地方很難探索。]], "_t")
t("misc", "雜項", "entity type")
t("gross", "雜項", "entity subtype")
t("Cut Drem Arm", "被切下來的德瑞姆手臂", "entity name")
t("bloody arm", "血淋淋的手臂", "_t")
t("The arm appears desiccated, but you swear that you see something wriggling underneath its ashen skin.", "這條手臂看上去已經風乾了，但你可以發誓，你看到有什麼東西在它的皮膚下蠕動。", "_t")
t("The arm can sometimes reach out to a foe in radius 5 and grab it to you with a tentacle pull. This action is not your own choice, it has a mind of its own.", "這條手臂有時可以伸向半徑5範圍內的一個敵人，用觸手把他拉到你的身邊。這個行爲並不出自於你的選擇，而是出於它自己的意志。", "_t")
t("#DARK_SEA_GREEN#The %s reaches for %s with a tentacle!", "#DARK_SEA_GREEN#%s使用觸手抓握%s!", "logSeen")
t("Monolith Armour", "巨石鎧甲", "entity name")
t("black stone armour", "黑色的石頭鎧甲", "_t")
t("This 'armour' seems to mostly consist of chunks of a rune etched stone somehow fused with a highly flexible black mesh. The titanic pieces of stone would undoubtedly deflect any blow thrown at you, but you would need obscene strength just to move while wearing this. The glyphs and runes carved into the chunks sometimes light up of their own accord, letting out small bursts of magic.", "這塊護甲似乎是由一整塊符文巨石組成，它與某種高度靈活的黑色網狀物融爲一體。毋庸置疑，巨大的石塊可以阻擋對你身上的任何打擊，但你需要巨大的力量才能穿着它移動。刻在上面的符文有時候會自動點亮，放出小型的魔法爆炸。", "_t")
t([[15% chance when hit to shatter reality around you creating rifts to help you (free cast of a Reality Fracture talent, level 4). This effect has a 30 turns cooldown.
#PURPLE#If your constitution drops below requirement while using it, it is so heavy you will automatically unequip it. Beware.#LAST#]], [[擊中時有15%的機率撕裂周圍的現實，在身邊創造一個時空裂痕來幫助你（免費釋放一次等級4的實境撕裂）這個效果的冷卻時間爲30回合。
#PURPLE#如果在你使用它的時候你的體質值降低到了裝備的需求以下，因爲它太重了，你會立刻解除裝備。要小心#LAST#]], "_t")
t("#LIGHT_RED#Your %s is too heavy to carry with your punny constitution anymore. You remove it.", "#LIGHT_RED#你的%s太重，你的體質無法裝備它。你放下了它。", "logPlayer")
t("Fanged Collar", "利牙項環", "entity name")
t("a necklace with fangs", "有尖牙的項鍊", "_t")
t("This strange creature seems to melt around your neck, keeping its mouth open just wide enough so that its teeth do not touch you. You suspect that in the case your head somehow goes missing, the creature is going to make itself at home in your neck stump.", "這個奇怪的生物圍繞着你的脖子，把嘴大長到牙齒剛好不會碰到你的距離。你懷疑，如果你哪天掉了腦袋，這個生物就會把你的脖子當做它的家。", "_t")
t("You have died, but that does not bother the collar at all...", "你已經死了，不過看起來這個項環上的生物一點也不在乎…", "_t")
t("Try to not die...", "你最好不要死……", "_t")
t("Perseverance", "毅力", "entity name")
t("always sharp blade", "永遠鋒利的劍", "_t")
t([[It is said that the preferred weapons of the krog is a mace in one hand and a sword in the other. One hand to spread the message of the Zigurath, the other to see that message through to the end.
The sword symbolizes the krogs committment to their task of fighting against the forces of the arcane. With each slash the krog would endevor to continue, until at last their opponents would fall.]], [[人們說克羅格首選的武器是一手拿劍一手拿錘。用一隻手傳播伊格蘭斯的訊息，而用另一隻手來讓自己能夠堅持到把這一信息傳達到最後。
劍象徵着克羅格堅守着他們對抗奧術力量的任務。直到最後一個敵人倒下之前，克羅格都會用這把劍堅持戰鬥。]], "_t")
t("restore 7 stamina and equilibrium", "恢復7點體力值和失衡值。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE#As you wear the sword you feel it attuning to your Krog body, increasing in power!", "#LIGHT_BLUE#你感受到你的劍和克羅格的身軀共鳴，解放了強大的力量!", "logPlayer")
t("It is said perseverance comes hand in hand with dedication.", "人們說毅力之劍與忠誠之錘配合。", "_t")
t("#AQUAMARINE#As the twin weapons of the Krogs are reunited you can feel bursting with power!", "#AQUAMARINE#克羅格的兩把武器在捏手中結合，你感覺到力量暴漲!", "logSeen")
t("#AQUAMARINE#The twin weapons of the Krogs de-power as you separate them.", "#AQUAMARINE#克羅格的武器被你分開，力量消退了。", "logPlayer")
t("Dedication", "忠誠", "entity name")
t("always blunt mace", "永遠鈍的錘", "_t")
t([[It is said that the preferred weapons of the krog is a mace in one hand and a sword in the other. One hand to spread the message of the Zigurath, the other to see that message through to the end.
The mace symbolizes the krogs willingness to endure until the final blow is struck against the arcane. Commonly the mace would be used to batter a mage senseless, thus preventing them from being able to cast their spells. ]], [[人們說克羅格首選的武器是一手拿劍一手拿錘。用一隻手傳播伊格蘭斯的訊息，而用另一隻手來讓自己能夠堅持到把這一信息傳達到最後。
錘象徵着克羅格願意抵抗奧術力量的侵襲直到最後。這把錘子用來擊打那些法師，可以讓那些法師失去施展魔法的能力。]], "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE#As you wear the mace you feel it attuning to your Krog body, increasing in power!", "#LIGHT_BLUE#你感受到你的錘和克羅格的身軀共鳴，解放了強大的力量！", "logPlayer")
t("charm", "護符", "entity type")
t("totem", "圖騰", "entity subtype")
t("Persistent Will", "不息意志", "entity name")
t("ever burning stake", "燃燒的木棍", "_t")
t([[During the Age of Dusk a rash of anti-magic activities took place in the Nargol Kingdom immediately after the Spellblaze. Citizens would turn on those with magical powers, burning them alive on stakes of wood. When the authorities found the perpetrators they executed them and planted their heads on stakes throughout their capital city.
Despite this however, the citizenry continued to burn alive the enemies of nature. Unbeknownst to the authorities, the heads of the dead perpetrators continued to spread their message long after their deaths.

This stake of wood appears to one of those used to prop up one of the executed heads. It has seemingly absorbed the will of the head it propped up, and holding it you can hear the Ziguranth's message echo through your mind.]], [[在黃昏紀的魔法大爆炸後，納格爾王國迅速爆發了反對法師的活動。民衆包圍那些使用魔法的人，將他們綁在木頭上活活燒死。納格爾王國鎮壓了這些肇事者，把他們的人頭插在遍佈首都的柱子上。
然而儘管如此，人民還是繼續與大自然的敵人戰鬥。當局所不知道的是，那些死去的反抗者的頭顱在他們死後仍然繼續傳遞着他們的反抗意志。

這段木頭似乎是曾經戳着一個被處決的人的人頭的。它似乎吸收了被它刺穿的頭顱的意志，拿着它，你可以感受到伊格蘭斯的意志在你在你的腦海迴響。]], "_t")
t("convince all non arcane users in radius 10 to turn on their spellcasting friends for 6 turns (chance increases with your Mindpower)", "使半徑10碼範圍內的非奧術魔法使用者攻擊奧術魔法使用者，持續6回合（機率隨精神強度提升）", "tformat")
t("Worm Nest", "蟲穴", "entity name")
t("disgusting robe", "噁心的長袍", "_t")
t("This unusually thick robe constantly wriggles and squirms. Small worms sometimes pop out of it, dropping to the floor. The worms will cushion attacks against your person, but you somehow do not like the idea of having so many parasitic creatures so close to your vulnerable flesh.", "這件異常厚重的長袍不斷蠕動。上面的小蠕蟲有時會從上面跳出來，掉到地板上。這些蠕蟲會緩衝敵人對你的攻擊，但是讓這這麼多寄生生物如此接近你脆弱的肉體…實在是太噁心了", "_t")
t("#GREEN#The worms embed themselves easily in your mutated skin.", "#GREEN#蠕蟲很容易嵌入你的變異皮膚中。", "logPlayer")
t("Light of Revelation", "揭示之光", "entity name")
t("disturbing lantern", "令人不安的燈籠", "_t")
t("The \"lantern\" appears to be a glowing shard of a glass-like substance. Despite how bright it is, its light deeply disturbs you. It illuminates everything in its wake, including things which you would rather not see. Part of you wants to throw it away, but another part wants to know the unearthly truths it will reveal to you.", "這個“燈籠”似乎是一塊發光的玻璃狀物體的碎片。儘管它十分明亮，但它的光卻讓你深感不安。它照亮了身邊的一切，包括你不願意看到的東西。你內心的一部分想要把它扔掉，但另一部分卻又渴望着它向你揭示的超自然的真相。", "_t")
t("Sometimes reveals the hidden truths you'd rather not see.", "有時會揭示你不應該知道的隱藏真相。", "_t")
t("#YELLOW#Light of Revelation shines on %s revealing its true nature as %s!", "#YELLOW#揭示之光照耀着%s，揭示了它實際上是%s！", "say")
t("Glowing Core", "光亮之核", "entity name")
t("burning core", "燃燒的核心", "_t")
t("This is all that's left of the Searing Horror. Even after its death, the object in your hand glows just as brightly as it did before.", "這是灼熱恐魔的殘餘部分。即使是在它死後，這個物體還是在你手中如同它活着的時候一樣發出閃耀的光芒。", "_t")
t("Shoes of Moving Slowly", "緩步之靴", "entity name")
t("restful shoes", "放鬆的鞋子", "_t")
t([[Fast does not always win.

#GOLD#Rumoured to be able to combine with the Shoes of Moving Quickly.]], [[快不一定是好事。

#GOLD#有人說這可以和疾行之靴結合。]], "_t")
t("Each turn you spend not moving gain a buff for 2 defense and armour. Stacks up to 12 times.", "每個你沒有移動的回合都能得到2點防禦和護甲值增益。最多疊加12次。", "_t")
t("combine it with the Shoes of Moving Quickly", "與疾行之靴結合", "_t")
t("You need to have the Shoes of Moving Quickly in your inventory.", "你需要一件疾行之鞋。", "logPlayer")
t("Shoes of Slowly Moving Quickly", "緩步疾行之靴", "_t")
t("A wonder of footwear! You can set a shoe to stay in place while the other one goes very fast, spinning around to create tornados!", "這是鞋子的奇蹟！你可以讓一隻腳待在原地不動，另一隻腳走得飛快，形成一道龍捲風！", "_t")
t([[Each turn you spend not moving gain a buff for 2 defense and armour. Stacks up to 12 times.
You move 3 spaces at once.]], [[每個你沒有移動的回合都能得到2點防禦和護甲值增益。最多疊加12次。
一次走3格。]], "_t")
t("As you combine the two pair of shoes you make something marvelous: %s", "當你將這兩件鞋子結合時，你製造出了神奇的道具: %s", "logPlayer")
t("Rod of Entropy", "熵之魔杖", "entity name")
t("light sucking rod", "吸收光的魔杖", "_t")
t("This rod seems to make light die around it. You feel tired just looking at it.", "這根魔杖似乎能夠熄滅周圍的光。光是看着它你就覺得很累了。", "_t")
t("temporarily causes the target to receive entropic backlash from any healing they receive for %d turns up to %d%% of the healing done. This effect scales with your Magic stat.", "暫時使目標從他們的治療中受到熵反衝，在%d回合內受到%d%%治療量傷害。效果受魔力值加成。", "tformat")
t("%s activates %s %s!", "%s激活了%s%s!", "logSeen")
t("Seeds of the Black Tree", "黑色樹之種", "entity name")
t("corrupt stone", "被污染的石頭", "_t")
t("This writhing mass of tentacles appears to have infested a mindstar, creating some bizarre fusion between natural and unnatural. The once clear gem now seems more like a shard of black obsidian with tentacles striking out from it like whips. You do not want to think of the implications of this horror being able to fuse with Nature itself.", "這團扭曲的觸手似乎感染了一塊靈晶，在自然和超自然之間形成了一種奇異的混合。曾經清晰的寶石現在看起來更像一塊黑曜石碎片，觸手在上面伸出，宛如鞭子一般。你無法想象，恐魔竟然能夠和大自然混合。", "_t")
t("15% chance to cast Tendrils Eruption level 3 on your target", "15%機率對目標施放等級3的觸手地獄", "_t")
