section "tome-cults/data/talents/misc/misc.lua"

t("glass golem", "玻璃傀儡", "_t")
t("Self-destruction", "自爆", "talent name")
t("Self destruct in a glorious explosion of gore dealing %0.2f blight damage to all enemies in %d radius.  Your summoner must be dead to use this talent.", "自爆成一團血肉，對周圍 %d 碼半徑內所有敵人造成 %0.2f 枯萎傷害。這個技能只有主人死亡時能夠使用。", "tformat", {2,1})
t("Teleport: Kroshkkur", "傳送: 克諾什庫爾", "talent name")
t("#CRIMSON#Kroshkkur is destroyed, there is nothing to teleport to.", "#CRIMSON#克諾什庫爾被摧毀了，無法傳送到那裏。", "logPlayer")
t("The spell fizzles...", "法術失敗了...", "logPlayer")
t("There are creatures that could be watching you; you cannot take the risk.", "有生物可以看見你，你不能冒這個險。", "log")
t([[Allows to teleport to Kroshkkur.
	You have studied the forbidden secrets there and have been granted a special portal spell to teleport back.
	This spell must be kept secret; it should never be used within view of uninitiated witnesses.
	The spell takes time (40 turns) to activate, and you must be out of sight of any other creature when you cast it and when the teleportation takes effect.]], [[允許傳送至克諾什庫爾。
	你學習了那裏的禁忌祕密，因此獲得了傳送至克諾什庫爾的法術。
	該法術必須保持機密；它在有其他人在場時不能使用。
	該法術需要 40 回合生效，在此期間你需要處於任何生物視線外。]], "_t")
t("Call of Amakthel", "阿馬克泰爾的呼喚", "talent name")
t("%s is pulled in!", "%s 被拉了進去！", "logSeen")
t("Pull all foes within radius 10 2 grids towards you.", "將10碼範圍內所有的目標朝你拉近2格。", "_t")
t("Crumble", "瓦解", "talent name")
t([[Fire a blast of darkness at an enemy dealing %0.2f damage and destroying any walls in radius 3 around them.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.]], "發射黑暗能量，對目標造成 %0.2f 傷害並破壞 3 格範圍內的牆壁。傷害受法術強度加成。", "tformat")
t("Blightlash", "枯萎鞭撻", "talent name")
t("You require an empty offhand to use your tentacle hand.", "你需要副手空手才能使用觸手。", "logPlayer")
t("You require a weapon and an empty offhand!", "你必須有一把武器和一隻空手！", "logPlayer")
t("Lash an enemy within range 10 with your tentacle, dealing %d%% blight damage.", "用觸手打擊 10 碼範圍內的一個敵人，造成 %d%% 枯萎傷害。", "tformat")
t("Twisted Evolution", "扭曲進化", "talent name")
t([[Evolve %d allies within radius 10 in random ways for 5 turns.
		#ORCHID#Speed:#LAST# Increases global speed by %d%%.
		#ORCHID#Form:#LAST# Increases all stats by %d.
		#ORCHID#Power:#LAST# Increases all damage by %d%%.]], [[進化 10 格範圍內至多 %d 名友方單位 5 回合。
		#ORCHID#速度:#LAST# 增加 %d%% 整體速度。
		#ORCHID#形態:#LAST# 增加 %d 全屬性。
		#ORCHID#力量:#LAST# 增加 %d%% 傷害。]], "tformat")
t("golem", "傀儡", "talent category")
t("glass", "玻璃", "talent type")
t("Glass Golem basic capacity.", "玻璃傀儡的基礎能力。", "_t")
t("Glass Splinters", "玻璃碎片", "talent name")
t("%s resists the splinters!", "%s 抵抗了玻璃碎片!", "logSeen")
t([[Smash your target with a splintering glass attack doing %d%% arcane weapon damage.
		If this attack hits the target will have glass splinters for 6 turns.
		Each turn the target will bleed for 8%% of the attack damage. The splinters are very painful and if the target moves it will instantly take %d%% of the attack damage.
		At level 5 the target suffers so much it has 15%% chances to fail using talents.]], [[ 使用玻璃碎片攻擊敵人，造成 %d%% 奧術武器傷害。
		如果攻擊命中，目標將被玻璃碎片扎 6 回合。
		每回合目標將受到 8%% 攻擊傷害的流血傷害。
		同時每當目標移動時，受到 %d%% 攻擊傷害。 
		技能等級 5 後，目標有 15%% 機率使用技能失敗。]], "tformat")
t("Throw Pebble", "投擲鵝卵石", "talent name")
t("something", "某物", "_t")
t("#Source# expertly hurls a pebble at #target#!", "#Source#朝#target#投擲鵝卵石!", "logCombat")
t([[Throw a pebble at your target, dealing %0.2f physical damage.
		The damage will increase with your Strength.]], [[朝目標扔石頭，造成 %0.2f 物理傷害。
		傷害受力量加成。]], "tformat")
t("Netherforce", "虛空之力", "talent name")
t([[Smash the target with the force of the void dealing %0.2f darkness and %0.2f temporal damage to the target and knocking them back 8 spaces.
		The power of this spell inflicts entropic backlash on you, causing you to take %d damage over 8 turns. This damage counts as entropy for the purpose of Entropic Gift.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[用虛空之力攻擊目標，造成 %0.2f 暗影 %0.2f 時空傷害並擊退 8 格。 
		該法術會產生熵能反衝，讓你在 8 回合內受到 %d 傷害。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/data/talents/misc/races.lua"

t("race", "種族技能", "talent category")
t("drem", "德瑞姆", "talent type")
t("The various racial bonuses a character can have.", " 多種多樣的種族天賦。", "_t")
t("Frenzy", "狂熱", "talent name")
t([[Enter a killing frenzy for 3 turns.
		During the frenzy the first time you use a class talent it has no cooldown (but does if used twice).
		This does not work for inscriptions, talents that take no turn to use, passives, or talents with fixed cooldowns.
		]], [[進入殺戮狂熱狀態 3 回合。
		狂熱狀態下，  你使用的第一個職業技能不進入冷卻（再次使用將進入冷卻。）
		該效果對紋身、符文、被動技能、瞬間技能以及固定冷卻時間技能無效。
		]], "tformat")
t("Spikeskin", "尖刺皮膚", "talent name")
t([[Your skin grows small spikes coated in dark blight.
		When you are hit in melee the attacker starts bleeding black blood for 5 turns that deals %0.2f darkness damage each turn. This effect may only happen once per turn.
		You are empowered by the sight of the black blood, for each bleeding creature in radius 2 you gain 5%% all resistances, limited to %d creatures.
		The damage will scale with your Magic stat.]], [[ 你的皮膚生長出被黑暗和枯萎力量覆蓋的尖刺。
		每回合你第一次被近戰攻擊命中時，尖刺對攻擊者造成傷害，對方將在 5 回合內每回合受到 %0.2f 黑暗流血傷害。
		同時，你將被敵人的鮮血鼓舞， 2 格範圍內每個流血生物（上限 %d ）爲你提供 5%% 全體傷害抗性。
		傷害隨魔法屬性提升。]], "tformat")
t("Faceless", "無面", "talent name")
t([[Your faceless visage is puzzling and emotionless, allowing you to more easily resist mind tricks.
		You gain %d mental save, %d%% confusion immunity.]], [[你無面孔的臉沒有情感，令人困惑。這讓你更容易抵抗精神衝擊。
		你獲得 %d 精神豁免， %d%% 混亂免疫。]], "tformat")
t("From Below It Devours", "自深淵吞噬萬物", "talent name")
t("Not enough space to summon!", "沒有足夠的空間召喚。", "logPlayer")
t("hungering mouth", "飢餓巨口", "_t")
t("\"From below, it devours.\"", "\"來自深淵，吞噬一切\"", "_t")
t([[Your affinity with things that dwell deep beneath the surface allows you to summon a hungering mouth.
		The mouth has %d bonus life, lasts for %d turns, and deals no damage.
		Each turn the mouth will draw all enemies in radius 10 2 spaces towards itself.
		Its bonus life depends on your Constitution stat and talent level.  Many other stats will scale with level.]], [[ 你同地下深處某物的聯繫讓你能召喚一隻飢餓大嘴。
		每回合它將周圍 10 格內生物朝自身拉近 2 格。
		它有 %d 額外生命，存在 %d 回合，不造成傷害。 
		它的額外生命取決於你的體質和技能等級。許多其他屬性受等級影響。]], "tformat")
t("\
For Drems this effect activates as long as the hungering mouth summoned by From Below It Devours is alive.", "\
對於德瑞姆，這一效果在“自深淵吞噬萬物”召喚的飢餓巨口仍然存活時持續生效。", "_t")
t("krog", "克羅格", "talent type")
t("Wrath of the Wilds", "自然之怒", "talent name")
t([[You unleash the wrath of the wilds for 5 turns.
		When you deal damage to a creature while wrath is active you have %d%% chance (100%% for the first creature hit each turn) to stun them for 3 turns.
		This effect can only stun a creature once per turn.
		Chance scales with your Constitution and apply power is the highest or your physical or mind power.]], [[你釋放持續 5 回合的自然的憤怒。
		憤怒狀態下，每當你造成傷害時有 %d%% （每回合攻擊的第一個生物 100%% ）機率震懾 3 回合。
		該效果每回合只能震懾一個敵人。
		震懾機率受體質影響，強度由物理或精神強度中較高一項決定。]], "tformat")
t("Drake-Infused Blood", "灌輸龍血", "talent name")
t("You must kill more enemies before you can use this talent!", "你需要殺死更多敵人才能使用該技能！", "logPlayer")
t("#GREEN#You can now change your elemental drake aspect", "#GREEN#你現在可以切換你的龍血類型了。", "say")
t("Fire Drake / Fire Resistance", "火龍 / 火焰抗性", "_t")
t("Cold Drake / Cold Resistance", "冰龍 / 寒冷抗性", "_t")
t("Storm Drake / Lightning Resistance", "風暴龍 / 閃電抗性", "_t")
t("Sand Drake / Physical Resistance (1/3rd values)", "沙龍 / 物理抗性（1/3數值）", "_t")
t("Wild Drake / Nature Resistance", "自然龍 / 自然抗性", "_t")
t("Acid Drake / Acid Resistance", "酸龍 / 酸性抗性", "_t")
t("Never mind", "沒事，別介意。", "_t")
t("#LAST# #{italic}#(current)#{normal}#", "#LAST# #{italic}#(當前)#{normal}#", "_t")
t("Drake Aspect", "龍血類型", "_t")
t("Choose an aspect to bring forth:", "選擇你使用的龍血類型：", "_t")
t([[Since ziguranth removed those filthy magic runes from your body you have needed an alternative form of power to sustain your body. Thanks to drake blood you have found that power.
		Your blood hardens yourself, passively increasing stun resistance by %d%%, %s resistance by %d%% and dealing %d %s damage on melee attacks.
		You can activate this talent to change which drake aspect to bring forth, altering the elemental type of the bonus.
		The resistance and damage scales with your Willpower.

		Changing your aspect requires combat experience, you may only do so after slaying 100 enemies (current %d).

		When you learn this talent you become so strong you can wield any type of one handed weapon in your offhand.]], [[ 伊格除去了你身體內部骯髒的魔法符文，並改用龍血提供能量維持你的身體。
		龍血強化了你，使你獲得 %d%% 震懾抗性， %d%% %s 傷害抗性， %d %s 近戰附加傷害。
		你可以主動開啓該技能來改變龍力類型，進而改變相應元素。
		抗性和附加傷害受意志值加成。
		改變類型需要戰鬥經驗，你必須殺死 100 生物後才能使用（當前 %d ）。
		
		當你學會該技能時，你變得如此強大，以至於能雙持任何單手武器。]], "tformat", {1,3,2,4,5,6})
t("Fuel Pain", "燃燒痛苦", "talent name")
t([[Your body is used to pain. When you take a hit of 20%% or more of your max life one of your inscriptions is taken off cooldown and infusion saturation is removed.
		This effect has a cooldown of %d turns.]], [[你的身體習慣於痛苦。每次你受到超過 20%% 最大生命的傷害時，你的一個紋身將立刻冷卻完畢，並移除符文飽和效果。
		該效果冷卻時間爲 %d 回合。]], "tformat")
t("Drakeblood Strike", "龍血打擊", "talent name")
t([[You were created by ziguranth for one purpose only, to wage war on magic!
			Strike your target dealing %d%% %s weapon damage and silencing them for %d turns.
			The damage type will change with your drake aspect.
			The chance to silence will increase with the highest of your physical or mind power.]], [[ 你被伊格製造的唯一理由：對魔法作戰！
		打擊你的敵人，造成 %d%% %s 武器傷害，並沉默它們 %d 回合。
		傷害類型根據龍血的類型而決定。
		沉默的機率受物理強度或精神強度的最高值加成。]], "tformat")
t("parasite", "寄生", "talent type")
t("The various racial bonuses a character can have.. when its head is cut off and replaced with a parasite.", "一個角色可以學習的各種種族技能……當它的頭被寄生獸取代的時候。", "_t")
t("Take a Bite", "咬一口", "talent name")
t("#Source# tries to bite #target#!", "#Source#試圖咬#target#!", "logCombat")
t("%s resists!", "%s抵抗了效果！", "logSeen")
t([[You try to bite off your foe with your #{italic}#head#{normal}# for %d%% blight weapon damage.
		If the target falls under 20%% life you have %d%% chances to outright kill it (bosses are immune).
		Whenever you succesfully bite a foe you regenerate %0.1f life per turn for 5 turns.
		Instant kill chances and regeneration increase with your Constitution stat and weapon damage increases with the highest of your Strength, Dexterity or Magic stat.]], [[ 你嘗試用 #{italic}#頭#{normal}# 咬你的敵人造成 %d%% 枯萎武器傷害。
		如果目標被咬後生命不足 20%% ，你有 %d%% 機率直接殺死它（對 boss 無效）。
		你咬中以後 5 回合內每回合回覆 %0.1f 生命。
		秒殺機率和生命回覆受體質加成，武器傷害受力量敏捷魔法中最高值影響。]], "tformat")
t("Ultra Instinct", "終極本能", "talent name")
t([[Without the distraction of #{bold}#thoughts#{normal}# or #{bold}#self#{normal}# your body reacts faster and better to aggressions.
		Increases global speed by %d%%.]], [[ 沒有 #{bold}#思維#{normal}# 和 #{bold}#自我#{normal}# 的干擾，你的身體全憑本能行動，反應速度更快。
		整體速度增加 %d%% 。]], "tformat")
t("Corrupting Influence", "墮落影響", "talent name")
t([[The parasite corruption seeps into your body, strengthening it.
		Increases blight, darkness, temporal and acid resistances by %d%% but decreases nature and light resistances by %d%%.]], [[ 寄生在你身體裏的墮落力量滲出了你的身體，給予你強化。
		增加 %d%% 枯萎、黑暗、時空和酸性傷害抗性，同時減少 %d%% 自然和光系傷害抗性。]], "tformat")
t("Horror Shell", "恐懼外殼", "talent name")
t([[Creates a shell around you, absorbing %d damage. Lasts for 10 turns.
		The total damage the shield can absorb increases with your Constitution.]], [[在你身邊製造一層持續 10 回合吸收 %d 傷害的外殼。
		吸收量受體質加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/data/talents/spell/necro.lua"

t("The massive ribcage in the middle beats with loud, audible cracks, as many a skeletal hand protrude forth, entwining, fusing, forming long skeletal appendages to support itself, while others crumble and collapse inward. During all this, somehow, it seems they grasp for you.", "中空的胸腔裏傳出巨大的破碎聲，似乎許多骷髏在裏面，突出，纏繞，融合，形成長長的骨架來支撐它，而其他部分倒塌向內。與此同時，似乎它們都想抓住你。", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#As the bone horror is destroyed you see the remaining bones reassembling in the form of new skeletons!", "#VIOLET#白骨恐魔被摧毀了，你看到剩餘的骨頭組成了骷髏!", "logSeen")

