section "tome-cults/data/zones/dremshor-tunnel/npcs.lua"

t("half formed drem", "半成型的德瑞姆", "entity name")
t("A small faceless humanoid with vaguely Dwarven features.  Its waraxe and shield look battered, rusted, and generally in ill repair.", "身材矮小且擁有部分矮人特徵的人形怪物。它的戰斧和盾牌看起來又鏽又鈍，幾乎從未修理過。", "_t")
t("The Amalgamation", "融合怪", "entity name")
t("Creating a living being from scratch is not an easy process. There are plenty of things which can go wrong, including multiple eyes, surplus limbs, too few brains and multiple bodies being fused into a single, raging mass of flesh and bone. Despite how bulky the creature is, it moves with supple ease, quickly closing the gap between you and it.", "從零開始創造一個生物並不是一件容易的事情。有很多地方可能出錯，比如多了點眼睛，多了點四肢，少了點腦子，或者把無數軀體融合成這樣一團血肉和骨骸組成的，蠕動着的巨大怪物。儘管這個生物體型龐大，它仍然可以輕快地移動，很快縮小了和你之間的距離", "_t")
t("and absorbed into the foul thing", "並被吸收到了那個骯髒的東西體內。", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#As %s takes an other blow you see part of it split into a drem!", "#CRIMSON#當%s受到打擊時，你會看到它的一部分分裂成一個德瑞姆！", "logSeen")

