section "tome-cults/data/zones/ft-cultist/npcs.lua"

t("Unspeakable Thing", "不可名狀之物", "entity name")
t("Through idiotic pride, one of the students has called this thing to your world. Thick, impenetrable darkness billows from its form, devouring all light around it. As the darkness touches you, you feel only one thing... Hunger. Bottomless, infinite hunger, as vast and unending as the void of space itself.", "一位學徒因爲愚蠢的驕傲而錯誤的把這樣東西召喚到了你的世界。深不可測的黑暗從他的身邊噴涌而來，吞噬着周圍的一切光芒。當黑暗觸及你的時候，你只感受到一件事…飢餓，無盡的飢餓，如同宇宙的虛空一樣廣闊而無窮無盡。", "_t")
t("unknown", "未知", "entity type")
t("unknown", "未知", "entity subtype")
t("The Teacher", "導師", "entity name")
t("A being from another world, or so it claims. Despite its wholly alien appearance, it is not particularly threatening nor does it appear to be malevolent. It will not say how it learned to manipulate the powers of entropy, merely stating that it has been to many different places and experienced many different things.", "這是一位來自另一個世界的生物，起碼它是這麼說的。儘管它的外形十分怪異，但是它並沒有表現出威脅，也沒有什麼惡意。他從不說出自己是怎麼獲得操縱熵的力量的，只是告訴你他曾經去過無數不同的地方，經歷無數不同的事情。", "_t")
