section "tome-cults/data/zones/ft-haze-cave/zone.lua"

t("A cave from ages old", "遠古洞穴", "_t")
t("%d Food Collected", "食物已收集：%d", "tformat")
t("Hungry", "飢餓", "_t")
t([[It's a cold night and you did not find anything to eat during the day. Your fur pelt doesn't do much to keep the cold out either. You're about to go out to hunt, but everyone else has warned you that you must not do that. The night is dangerous and there appears to be strange lights in the sky. An ill omen, to say the least. Food has been hard to come by lately, so everyone is just as famished as you are.

The many tentacled ones who sometimes come down from the sky to look at you say that they are going to battle with themselves. You did not really understand why they would fight among themselves, even as it tried to explain it to you. You reconsider the idea of going outside when its warnings come across your mind, but the rumbling in your belly renews your resolve. Everyone in your tribe tonight must eat, no matter what.]], [[這是一個寒冷的夜晚，白天你沒有找到任何可以果腹的東西，你的儲備的皮毛也不足以禦寒。於是你決定外出狩獵，但其他人都警告你不要這樣做。夜晚很危險，而且天空也閃爍着詭異的光芒，如此不詳的預兆。但近來食物已經越來越難得，每個人都和你一樣飢餓。

有許多長着觸手的怪物從天而降，告訴你，他們將要相互交戰。你不知道他們爲什麼要整天自相殘殺，即使他們想要向你解釋，你也無法聽懂。當它的警告出現在你腦海中時，你有重新考慮是否要走出去的想法，但肚子裏的隆隆聲會讓你重新下定決心。不管怎樣，今晚你們部落的每個人都必須吃飯。]], "_t")
t("Why is there a dead tentacled one here?", "爲什麼這裏有一隻死掉的觸手怪？", "_t")
t("Corpses are raining from the sky...", "大量的屍體在從天上掉下來…", "_t")
t("The many tentacled ones are piling on the ground, forming mass graves.", "許多觸手怪的屍體堆積在地上，形成了萬人坑。", "_t")
t("What are these things?!", "這些是什麼東西？！", "_t")
t("Your primitive mind recoils in horror from the thing in front of you.", "你的原始思維在恐懼中從眼前的事物中退縮。", "_t")
t("Why are they killing each other? For what reason does this horror have to happen?", "他們爲什麼要互相殘殺？爲什麼會發生這種恐怖的事？", "_t")
t("You have fought against other tribes before, but the bloodshed you saw then is nothing compared to this.", "你們從前曾經與別的部落爭戰，但你們所看見的流血，與這相比，算不得什麼。", "_t")
t("You do not have the words you need to articulate your horror.", "你無法用語言表達你的恐懼。", "_t")
t("Are the many tentacled ones using these creatures against each another?", "那些觸手怪物是不是在用這些生物互相攻擊？", "_t")
t("Little of what you're seeing makes sense to you. You simply don't have the words to articulate the terror you're feeling.", "你所看到的一切都無法理解。你根本無法用語言表達你所感受到的恐懼。", "_t")
t("Great blasts of light come from the sky.", "天空發出巨大的光。", "_t")
t("Indescribable things are emerging from the darkness.", "無法形容的事情正在從黑暗中浮現。", "_t")
t("Looking up, you see something writhing between the stars. You look away before curiosity gets the better of you.", "擡頭一看，你看到星星間有東西在扭動。你要在好奇心戰勝你之前把目光移開。", "_t")
t("The lights nearly blind you as cascades of swirling colours explode in the darkness above your head.", "當漩渦般的色彩在你頭頂的黑暗中爆發時，強光幾乎使你失明。", "_t")
t("Terrified by the carnage around it, the rabbit has become easy prey.", "兔子被周圍的大屠殺嚇壞了，成了容易被捕食的獵物。", "_t")
t("A good little meal, but you will need more than this.", "一頓美餐，但你還需要更多。", "_t")
t("Meat has been a rare treat as of late.", "到目前爲止，肉是一種罕見的食物。", "_t")
t("#ANTIQUE_WHITE#Grung: %s", "#ANTIQUE_WHITE#格朗格: %s", "log")

