section "tome-cults/data/zones/ft-horrors/npcs.lua"

t("The One That Writes", "故事撰寫者", "entity name")
t("Even as this creature focuses its attention on you, many of its tentacles are preoccupied with writing letters onto sheets of strange, wispy parchment. With every word it finishes, the environment around you changes its shape, objects become more defined and patches of ground appear to be more detailed. You don't want to know the ending it has planned for your story.", "儘管它注意到了你，它的衆多觸鬚仍然繼續專注地在一張奇怪的纖細羊皮紙上書寫着文字。隨着它的書寫，你周圍的一切都在發生着變化，身邊的物體和地面變得更加清晰。你可不想讓他決定你人生故事的結尾。", "_t")
t("and written off the story", "並被從故事裏移除了", "_t")

