section "tome-cults/hooks/bonestaff.lua"

t("#GREY##{italic}#You feel the bones of the staff creeking and vibrating in your hand.#{normal}##LAST# Yes... #{italic}#\"master\"#{normal}#.", "#GREY##{italic}#你感受到手中的骨杖在你的手上顫動：#{normal}##LAST# 是的……#{italic}#“主人”#{normal}#.", "_t")
t("#GREY##{italic}#The vibrations feel like a shrug.#{normal}##LAST# By magic #{bold}#obviously#{normal}#. What kind of necromancer might you be to ask such #{bold}#stupid#{normal}# questions?", "#GREY##{italic}#骨杖發出了像是聳肩的顫動#{normal}##LAST# #{bold}#當然是#{normal}#被死靈魔法變成這樣的。什麼樣的死靈法師會問出這樣#{bold}#愚蠢#{normal}#的問題？", "_t")
t("#GREY##{italic}#The vibrations intensify.#{normal}##LAST# As long as this means more deaths and bones, I will agree to change aspect. Which do you choose?", "#GREY##{italic}#顫動加強了。#{normal}##LAST#只要這意味着更多的死亡和骨頭，我會同意改變類型。你選哪一個？", "_t")
t("Is there anything else you can do?", "你還能做什麼嗎？", "_t")
t("#GREY##{italic}#The staff shudders.#{normal}##LAST# My finest services are only available to real necromancers. Stop bothering me, inferior creature.", "#GREY##{italic}#法杖抖動了一下。#{normal}##LAST# 我最好的服務只提供給真正的死靈法師。別煩我了，低等生物。", "_t")
t("I am ready to use your powers!", "我準備好使用你的力量了！", "_t")
t("I want you to start summoning the bone horror again.", "我想讓你開始召喚骨靈恐魔。", "_t")
t("I want you to stop summoning the bone horror.", "我想讓你開始停止召喚骨靈恐魔。", "_t")
t([[#GREY##{italic}#You feel the staff writhing in your hand with dark intents.#{normal}##LAST# Once you will have collected one hundred souls and one class talent point I will be able to enhance your pathetic summons with a mighty bone horror!
Anytime you use your Create Minions spell I will make sure one of them is a Bone Horror, if none are present.

#ANTIQUE_WHITE#The Bone Horror is a powerful undead bone construct with multiple bone-based attacks and a bone shield. Upon death it splits into 3 skeleton minions.
#GREY#You have captured %d souls out of the 100 needed.]], [[#GREY##{italic}#你感受到手中的法杖隨着黑暗的意圖旋轉。#{normal}##LAST# 一旦你收集了100個靈魂和一個職業技能點，我將能夠增強你可憐的召喚能力，讓你可以召喚骨靈恐魔！
任何時候的，當你召喚不死隨從的時候，你將可以召喚一個骨靈恐魔，如果當前沒有的話。

#ANTIQUE_WHITE#骨靈恐魔是強大的不死白骨生物，擁有多種骨系攻擊技能，並且具有骨盾。骨靈恐魔死亡的時候會分裂出三個骷髏隨從。
#GREY#你已經收集了%d個靈魂，共需要收集100個靈魂。]], "tformat")
t("That could be handy.", "這很有用。", "_t")
t([[#GREY##{italic}#You feel the staff in your hand glowing with dark powers.#{normal}##LAST# At last! You sure took your sweet time #{italic}#"necromancer"#{normal}#!
Anyway, I have now enough souls to be able to summon the bone horror.
Do you wish to imbue me with a class talent point to finally become a real necromancer?

#ANTIQUE_WHITE#The Bone Horror is a powerful undead bone construct with multiple bone-based attacks and a bone shield. Upon death it splits into 3 skeleton minions.
]], [[#GREY##{italic}#你感覺到你手中的杖在閃耀着黑暗的力量！#{normal}##LAST# 終於！你真的花了不少時間，#{italic}#"死靈法師"#{normal}#!
不管怎樣，我現在有足夠的靈魂來召喚骨靈恐魔了。
你想花費一個職業技能點，成爲一個真正的死靈法師嗎？

#ANTIQUE_WHITE#骨靈恐魔是強大的不死白骨生物，擁有多種骨系攻擊技能，並且具有骨盾。骨靈恐魔死亡的時候會分裂出三個骷髏隨從。
]], "_t")
t("I do. (#YELLOW#spend 1 class point#LAST#)", "好的。(#YELLOW#消耗1點職業技能點。#LAST#)", "_t")
t("I can't. (#LIGHT_RED#you need one class point#LAST#)", "我不行。(#LIGHT_RED#你沒有職業技能點#LAST#)", "_t")
t("Not now.", "暫時不用。", "_t")
t("#GREY##{italic}#The staff shudders.#{normal}##LAST# Pathetic.", "#GREY##{italic}#法杖顫抖着。#{normal}##LAST# 真可憐。", "_t")
t([[#GREY##{italic}#The staff vibrates with great intensity.#{normal}##LAST# POWER! YES!
ALL SHALL BOW BEFORE MY MIGH... your might.]], [[#GREY##{italic}#法杖劇烈地顫動這#{normal}##LAST# 力量！是的！
所有人都將屈服於我的…啊不，你的力量。]], "_t")
t("Great!", "太棒了!", "_t")
t("#GREY##{italic}#The staff stays calm.#{normal}##LAST# Stupid useless pathetic excuse of a #{italic}#\"necromancer\"#{normal}#! Why refuse to use true power?!", "#GREY##{italic}#法杖平靜了下來。#{normal}##LAST#像你這樣的#{italic}#\"死靈法師\"#{normal}#竟然會用這樣蹩腳的藉口! 爲什麼要拒絕使用真正的力量?!", "_t")
t("I have my reasons!", "我有我的理由！", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/init.lua"

t("Forbidden Cults", "禁忌邪教", "init.lua long_name")
t([[Not all adventurers seek fortune, not all that defend the world have good deeds in mind.
Lately the number of sightings of horrors have grown tremendously. People wander off the beaten paths only to be found years later, horribly mutated and partly insane, if they are found at all. It is becoming evident something is stirring deep below Maj'Eyal.
That something is you.
]], [[不是所有的冒險者都在尋求財富，也不是所有保衛世界的人都心存善念。最近，恐魔在大陸上出現的次數急劇增加。不斷有人在偏僻的小路上失蹤，有時幾年後才被人發現，身體卻遭受了恐怖的變異，進入了瘋狂之中，也有時候再也無法尋到蹤跡。很明顯，在馬基·埃亞爾的大地深處，有某種東西正在暗中活動。
那種東西——就是你。
]], "init.lua description")

