section "tome-cults/overload/mod/class/CultsDLC.lua"

t("Insanity", "瘋狂值", "_t")
t([[Your mental insanity.  The higher it is the more random your damage and cooldowns become.

Damage and cooldowns have a chance to increase or decrease by up to chaotic%.

Both the chance and size of effects will increase with insanity.]], [[你的精神的瘋狂程度。 這一數值越高，你的技能的冷卻時間和所造成的傷害隨機性就越大。

傷害和冷卻時間將會在 混沌度% 的範圍內上下浮動。

浮動的機率和浮動的效果都會隨瘋狂值提升而上升。]], "_t")
t("%d%%%% (%d%%%% chaotic)", "%d%%%% (%d%%%% 混沌度)", "tformat")
t("Use the book-like display for Forbidden Tomes. This option requires both framebuffers and shaders to be active in the video options.#WHITE#", "在禁忌之書中使用書本般的現實效果。這一效果需要在圖像設置裏開啓幀緩衝和着色器。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#GOLD##{bold}#Forbidden Cults: Use Book visual for forbidden tomes#WHITE##{normal}#", "#GOLD##{bold}#禁忌邪教：禁忌之書使用書本效果#WHITE##{normal}#", "_t")
