t("disabled", "已禁用", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#This was a very satisfying meal, 'you' feel strengthened. (+1 generic talent point)", "#CRIMSON#這份餐營養豐富，“你”覺得自己變強了（+1通用技能點）", "log")
t("#CRIMSON#[The parasite loves death and pain and gives no choice but to shoot down the airship]", "#CRIMSON#[寄生獸喜歡殺戮和痛苦，直接幫你按下了擊落飛船的按鈕。]", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#[The parasite is hungry and promptly swallows and eat Melinda].", "#CRIMSON#[寄生獸很餓，吃下了梅琳達].", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#[The parasite is hungry and promptly swallows and eat Aeryn].", "#CRIMSON#[寄生獸很餓，吃下了艾琳].", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#[The parasite is hungry and attacks Slasul].", "#CRIMSON#[寄生獸很餓，攻擊了薩拉蘇爾].", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#[The parasite is hungry and promptly swallows and eat %s].", "#CRIMSON#[寄生獸很餓，吃下了%s]。", "tformat")
t("#CRIMSON#[The parasite is hungry and takes over the conversation.]#LAST# I smelled a weakling here and wanted a nice meal. [point your finger at the captured merchant]", "#CRIMSON#[寄生獸很餓，終止了你的對話。]#LAST#我聞到這裏有股弱者的味道，我想要一頓美餐。[把你的手指指向被抓住的商人]", "_t")
t("Ah I see, you are a ...thing... of special tastes. Very well, I'd rather have you as a friend so have your meal and someday we may have some more business to do together.", "啊，我明白了，你是一個…品味獨特的…傢伙。很好，我希望你是我的朋友，所以吃吧，總有一天我們會有更多的生意要做。", "_t")
t("[eat the merchant]", "[吃掉商人]", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#[The parasite is hungry and promptly swallows and eat Fillarel]#LAST# No I have not...", "#CRIMSON#[寄生獸很餓，直接吃掉了菲拉瑞爾]#LAST# 不，我不…", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#[The parasite is hungry and promptly swallows and eat the yeek wayist]#LAST# I 'saved' you to get a nice meal...", "#CRIMSON#[寄生獸很餓，直接吃掉了奪心魔靈能力者]#LAST# 我“救你”是爲了美餐一頓", "_t")
t("#RED#You can't enter a Forbidden Tome from here!#LAST#", "#RED#你不能在這裏進入禁忌之書！#LAST#", "log")
t("The protagonist of the story is dead.", "故事的主角死了。", "_t")
t("#PURPLE#%s starts to crumble to dust, it will be gone once you exit it!", "#PURPLE#%s開始粉碎成塵土，如果你離開這本書，它就會消失！", "log")
